> > > > > > > > > > > > > +              formula = coordinates ~ point_field + Inter_point,
> > > > > > > > > > > > > +              data = data1,
> > > > > > > > > > > > > +              ips = ips)
> > > > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > lik2 <- like("normal",
> > > > > > > > > > > > > +              formula = size_ha ~ Inter_mark + point_field*scaling + mark_field +
> > > > > > > > > > > > > +              DC+GDP+density+total+rural+agriculture+industry +services +forest,
> > > > > > > > > > > > > +              data = data1)
> > > > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > > > > fit <- bru(cmp, lik1, lik2, options=list(verbose=TRUE))
> > > > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > > > Error in row_kron(A[[k + 1]], A_) :
> > > > > > > > > > > > >   Size mismatch for row.kron, (n1, n2) = (1, 0)
> > > > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > > > Do you know what I am doing wrong?
