Subject: SmoothCon error : unused arguments
Message-ID: <K_93CW7z0nE.dIXKlJR5BAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/K_93CW7z0nE/m/dIXKlJR5BAAJ>
