Subject: Re: [r-inla] Error when adding factor variables into R-INLA stack
Message-ID: <aI3m3ax3pSk.NBwWgwb0BAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <aI3m3ax3pSk.03WOZs7yBAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
References: <aI3m3ax3pSk.TWkOl8noBAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com> <aI3m3ax3pSk.03WOZs7yBAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
